# NBSC PRIME-HRM Intelligence Hub — Implementation Plan: Phases 2 to 6

This implementation plan details the technical execution strategy for **Phases 2 through 6** of the NBSC PRIME-HRM Intelligence Hub, adhering to the strict architecture of:
- **Frontend**: Pure HTML5 + Vanilla CSS (BEM) + Modern Vanilla JS (zero frameworks, zero inline styles `style=""`, zero inline `<script>` tags, isolated page folders).
- **Backend**: Django REST API (JSON only, MongoEngine ODM, Argon2/JWT authentication, RBAC).

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Phase-by-Phase Execution Sequence**:
> Phases 2 through 6 encompass a large scope. It is recommended to execute phase-by-phase with verification checkpoints:
> 1. **Phase 2 (Recruitment Core)**: Vacancies API, Public Job Board, Applicant Multi-step Application Wizard, 8-Stage Tracker, and Sortable.js Kanban Pipeline.
> 2. **Phase 3 (Hiring Intelligence & Audit)**: 4-Pillar DSS Scoring Engine, Dept Head Evaluations, HRMPSB Deliberation Console, Appointment Resolution, and SHA-256 Hash Chain.
> 3. **Phase 4 (Payroll & Encrypted Payslips)**: Excel Ingestion, ReportLab PDF Builder, PyPDF2 AES Encryption, and Employee Self-Service Download Hub.
> 4. **Phase 5 (SARA Voice AI Assistant)**: Gemini Flash LLM, RAG Policy Pipeline, Role-Scoped DB Tools, Web Speech STT/TTS, and Audio Canvas Visualizer.
> 5. **Phase 6 (Polish & Deployment)**: Notifications Dispatcher, Settings Dashboard, Live Chart Wiring, and Docker Compose Orchestration.

